  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The spacing of a diffraction grating is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span>. What is the angle between the two fourth-order maxima when the grating is illuminated normally by monochromatic light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{a}{3}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( \\frac{3}{4} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"sin^{-1}\\left ( \\frac{4}{3} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2sin^{-1}\\left ( \\frac{3}{4} \\right )\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">No fourth order maxima appear in the pattern.</li>\n</ol>"
  },
